# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.
# One address for search engines: the bare domain goes permanently to https://www.steeltoolsindia.in (Netlify;
# on Cloudflare Pages set this up as a Bulk Redirect or a redirect rule instead — Pages skips domain-level lines).
https://steeltoolsindia.in/*    https://www.steeltoolsindia.in/:splat    301!
http://steeltoolsindia.in/*     https://www.steeltoolsindia.in/:splat    301!
# Prerendered pages are served as-is; any other URL falls back to the app shell.
/*    /index.csr.html    200
